  "type": "Lemma",
  "number": "2.4.24",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  If is a matrix in row echelon form (recall ) then the non-zero rows of are a basis of .    The nonzero rows of are linearly independent by , and span by definition. They thus by definition form a basis for .   "
